Hits the target with your weapon, doing [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5)] damage. If the attack hits, the target's armour and saves are reduced by [5, 10, 15, 20, 25 (TL1-5)] for [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

Also if the target is protected by any temporary magical or psionic damage absorbing shields there is [-7%, 36%, 57%, 69%, 77% (TL1-5)] chance to shatter one random shield.

Armor reduction chance increases with your Physical Power.
